{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>and in the wilderness, where you saw.</b> This refers back to the verse above — <b>ככל אשר עשה אתכם במצרים</b> — and He did likewise <b>במדבר אשר ראית אשר נשאך וגו'</b>." "<b>as a man carries his son.</b> As I explained at ״וַיִּסַּע מַלְאַךְ הָאֱלֹהִים הַהֹלֵךְ לִפְנֵי מַחֲנֵה יִשְׂרָאֵל וְגוֹ״ (Exodus 14): a parable of one walking on the road with his son walking ahead of him — bandits came to seize him, etc."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:45:34.352321178Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}